      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While omeprazole helps reduce acid, it does not completely protect your stomach from all the potential side effects of NSAIDs like Advil. Even a short course of ibuprofen carries a risk of stomach irritation or upset. To be safest, please check the package insert for a warning section regarding use with proton pump inhibitors, or try acetaminophen which is generally gentler on the stomach. If the pain is unbearable, please consider calling a nurse advice line if an in-person visit isn't immediately possible.",
